freekit.mcpServers.markdownDescription:
MCP servers started by the extension (stdio transport). Example:
```json
{
  "filesystem": {
    "command": "npx",
    "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem", "."]
  }
}
```
The `.vscode/mcp.json` file (format `{"servers": {...}}`) takes priority over this setting. Changes are applied automatically (reload with debounce).
